OL,3,APiddington to bring legal challenge
OL,4,Aover asylum base plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government will face a legal
OL,7,Fchallenge over plans to convert a
OL,8,Fformer military site near Piddington
OL,9,Finto accommodation for more than 1,200
OL,10,Fdetained asylum seekers, the parish
OL,11,Fcouncil chairman has said.
OL,13,FPlanning permission for the development
OL,14,Fat the MoD Bicester site in Oxfordshire
OL,15,Fwas approved by the Housing Secretary
OL,16,FAngela Rayner after the Home Office
OL,17,Fused a fast-track route for projects
OL,18,Fdeemed to be urgently needed and of
OL,19,Fnational importance.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
