OL,3,ADoctor burnout putting maternity
OL,4,Apatients at risk, says regulator
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraining doctors working on maternity
OL,7,Fwards are experiencing high rates of
OL,8,Fburnout which could have a "critical
OL,9,Fimpact" on patients, a regulator is
OL,10,Fwarning.
OL,12,FThe General Medical Council (GMC) says
OL,13,Fthe fully qualified doctors, who are
OL,14,Fstill training in obstetrics and
OL,15,Fgynaecology, are reporting more
OL,16,Ffeelings of overwork and sleep
OL,17,Fdeprivation than similar trainees in
OL,18,Fany other field of medicine or surgery,
OL,19,Fand are also more wary of escalating
OL,20,Fconcerns.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
