OL,3,ADoctor burnout putting maternity
OL,4,Apatients at risk, says regulator
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthor Adam Kay, who left medicine in
OL,7,F2010 after dealing with a traumatic
OL,8,Fbirth incident, says the report "makes
OL,9,Ffor miserable reading" and says
OL,10,F"nothing has been done" to improve
OL,11,Fworkplace culture.
OL,13,FThe Department for Health and Social
OL,14,FCare said ensuring every maternity unit
OL,15,F"meets the highest standards" was a
OL,16,Fpriority.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
